{"seq":2,"slug":"context-from-recurring-mistakes","title":"从反复出错反推该补什么","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/project-context-files/maintaining-context-files/context-from-recurring-mistakes","wordCount":1985,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"从反复出错反推该补什么\">从反复出错反推该补什么</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>判断一条上下文该不该写、写什么,最容易陷入两种无效模式:凭空罗列&quot;agent 可能需要的东西&quot;,或者把文档写得面面俱到却无人问津。存在一个信号质量高得多的来源:<strong>agent 和人反复出的错</strong>。这个思路已经不是民间偏方,而是被写进了主流工具的官方方法论——Claude Code 文档明确列出四个&quot;该往 CLAUDE.md 加东西&quot;的触发条件:Claude 第二次犯同样的错、code review 抓到它本该知道的本仓库知识、你第二次在聊天里输入同一条纠正、以及新同事入职也需要同样的背景(<a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/memory\">Claude Code 文档</a>)。四条的公共结构都是&quot;重复&quot;:单次失误是噪声,重复出现的失误才是系统性缺口的精确坐标。本节讲怎么把错误分类成诊断信号、怎么换算补写的成本收益、以及怎么把它变成一台持续运转的改进回路。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>把错误变成补给信号，靠四个概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>重复才是阈值</strong>：单次失误是采样噪声，同一件事错两次以上才说明存在稳定的知识缺口。</li>\n<li><strong>四类诊断信号</strong>：猜错同一事实=缺规则、反复踩同一个坑=缺警告、反复被问同一个问题=答案藏太深、照上下文做反而错=原文要修。</li>\n<li><strong>成本准入</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>≫</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p \\cdot N \\cdot c_r \\gg c_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>——以月计的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 面前，写记录的成本几乎总可忽略。</li>\n<li><strong>验证性准入</strong>：重复性决定「要不要记」，验证性（如 Voyager 只在动作被验证有效后固化）决定「什么时候记」。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一句话：重复错误是上下文缺口的免费、高精度探针。</p>\n<h2 id=\"四类信号的诊断表\">四类信号的诊断表</h2><p>重复性故障可以按&quot;症状 → 缺口&quot;分成四类,每类的补法与落点不同:</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>症状</th>\n<th>诊断</th>\n<th>补法</th>\n<th>落点选择</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>反复猜错同一事实(命令/路径/约定)</td>\n<td>该知道的没写</td>\n<td>写成具体可执行的规则,如&quot;commit 前跑 npm test&quot;,而非&quot;记得测试&quot;</td>\n<td>根级文件;团队通用则进版本库共享</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反复踩同一个坑</td>\n<td>坑没写,或写了不够醒目</td>\n<td>显式警告+原因+替代做法三件套</td>\n<td>尽量就近:嵌套 AGENTS.md,或 Claude Code 的 <code>.claude/rules/</code> 按 glob 圈定作用域</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反复被问同一个问题</td>\n<td>答案不在上下文,或藏得太深</td>\n<td>把答案收拢到入口文件并用 import 引用</td>\n<td>Claude 的 <code>@path</code> 导入最深递归 4 层(<a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/memory\">文档</a>)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>照上下文做反而错</td>\n<td>那条上下文本身过期或错了</td>\n<td>原地修改或删除那条,而不是另加新规则</td>\n<td>找到确切文件修掉,并检查兄弟文件是否有同样的错</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第四类最容易被误处理:看到 agent 照文档做错了,本能反应是&quot;再叮嘱一句&quot;,结果新旧两条并存——恰好制造了 Claude 文档警告过的冲突任意择一场景。正确的动作是修源头:那条规则要么错了要么过期了,加新条目只会让下一个 session 的裁决更随机。</p>\n<p>动笔之前还应做一次<strong>归因</strong>。并非所有重复故障都指向知识缺口:依赖安装失败、端口占用、网络抖动这类环境性故障,重复出现也不该写成上下文——它们要么该被脚本修掉,要么该进 CI 的失败清单。检验标准是反事实的:假如上下文里存在一条完美规则,这个错还会发生吗?仍会发生,那是工具链或环境的缺陷;不会发生,才轮到上下文出场。跳过这一步的项目,最终会把上下文文件变成故障垃圾场——而 Claude 文档给出的体量红线(&lt;200 行)意味着每一条垃圾都在挤占真规则的遵循度(<a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/memory\">Claude Code 文档</a>)。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么-反复-才是阈值\">为什么&quot;反复&quot;才是阈值</h2><p>单次失误不值得动笔:agent 本身有采样随机性,一次猜错可能只是波动;同一件事错两次以上,才说明存在一个稳定的知识缺口。这个直觉可以用一个简单的成本模型表达(原创启发式):设某缺口导致失误的概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>,单次失误的修复成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>,项目未来任务数的期望为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>,写一条记录的成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>,那么只要</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mtext>  </mtext><mo>≫</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>w</mi></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo>⟹</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>第一次确认即应写入</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p \\cdot N \\cdot c_r \\;\\gg\\; c_w \\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad \\text{第一次确认即应写入}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.675em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟹</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">第一次确认即应写入</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>以月计的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 面前,<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>(几分钟的整理)几乎总是远小于期望损失。真正稀缺的从来不是写记录的成本,而是&quot;意识到该写&quot;的触发器——而重复错误正是免费且高精度的触发器。</p>\n<p>学术侧早有对应物。Reflexion 让 agent 把失败的经验以自然语言反思存入情景记忆并跨尝试复用,显著提升了后续任务成功率,相当于把&quot;出错 → 写下来 → 变强&quot;内建进推理过程(<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2303.11366\">Reflexion, arXiv:2303.11366</a>);Voyager 的技能库则只在动作被验证有效后才固化入库,提示了写入时机的另一面:确认有效的修正才值得沉淀,未验证的猜测先放观察区(<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2305.16291\">Voyager, arXiv:2305.16291</a>)。两者合起来恰好定义了回路的准入标准:重复性决定&quot;要不要记&quot;,验证性决定&quot;什么时候记&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"回路怎么转起来\">回路怎么转起来</h2><p>把零散的&quot;出错 → 纠正&quot;升级成回路,关键是给每个环节一个明确的去处:</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;agent 出错&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;同类错误第几次?&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;第一次&quot;| C[&quot;记入观察区,不动笔&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;重复出现&quot;| D[&quot;按四类症状定位缺口&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E{&quot;是照上下文做的?&quot;}&#10;    E --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| F[&quot;修原条目,查同类文件&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| G[&quot;写成新规则或警告,就近落盘&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; H[&quot;下个 session 验证&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; I{&quot;复发吗?&quot;}&#10;    I --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| J[&quot;提高显著性或上移作用域&quot;]&#10;    J --&gt; H&#10;    I --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| K[&quot;完成,留档&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"agent 出错\"] --&gt; B{\"同类错误第几次?\"}\n    B --&gt;|\"第一次\"| C[\"记入观察区,不动笔\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"重复出现\"| D[\"按四类症状定位缺口\"]\n    D --&gt; E{\"是照上下文做的?\"}\n    E --&gt;|\"是\"| F[\"修原条目,查同类文件\"]\n    E --&gt;|\"否\"| G[\"写成新规则或警告,就近落盘\"]\n    F --&gt; H[\"下个 session 验证\"]\n    G --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; I{\"复发吗?\"}\n    I --&gt;|\"是\"| J[\"提高显著性或上移作用域\"]\n    J --&gt; H\n    I --&gt;|\"否\"| K[\"完成,留档\"]</pre><p>工具生态已经替这个回路自动化了几个环节。Claude Code 的 auto memory 让 Claude 自己把你的纠正与偏好写成笔记,每个 session 自动装载(上限为前 200 行或 25KB),等于给回路配了一个自动记账员(<a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/memory\">Claude Code 文档</a>)。落点上,Codex 按目录层级拼接指令且离当前工作目录越近越后出现、效力越强(<a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/agent-configuration/agents-md.md\">Codex 文档</a>),所以针对某个服务的纠正应放进该服务目录下的嵌套文件而非根文件——作用域越准,下次被看见的概率越高。Gemini CLI 则提供了验证手段:<code>/memory show</code> 直接查看生效内容里有没有你刚写的那条(<a href=\"https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/blob/main/docs/cli/gemini-md.md\">Gemini CLI 文档</a>)。</p>\n<h2 id=\"别让补丁变成新病\">别让补丁变成新病</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>逐字倾倒。</strong> 把每次聊天纠正的原句粘进全局文件,几周后它就会撞上体量红线(Claude 建议 &lt;200 行,Codex 默认 32 KiB 截断),整体遵循度反而下降。补丁应当被蒸馏成最小可执行规则,而不是存档对话。</li>\n<li><strong>模糊警告。</strong> &quot;小心处理配置相关逻辑&quot;不可执行也不可验证;有效的坑位记录包含触发条件、后果、正确做法三个可检验要素。</li>\n<li><strong>只修症状不落盘。</strong> 每个 session 都在聊天里纠正同一件事,却从不写进文件——Claude Code 每 session 从空 context window 起步,聊天记忆不会跨会话存活(<a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/memory\">文档</a>)。</li>\n<li><strong>无人审计的 auto memory。</strong> 自动笔记也是上下文,一样会过期、会互相矛盾;它降低的是记录成本,不豁免审阅责任。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>重复错误是上下文缺口的免费探针:猜错等于缺规则,踩坑等于缺警告,反复问等于缺答案,照做错等于原文要修。判定靠&quot;第二次&quot;,时机靠验证,落盘讲究就近与蒸馏。下一节把这个回路上升为态度——把上下文当活文档养。</p>\n<h2 id=\"相关阅读\">相关阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"keeping-context-fresh\">保持上下文新鲜</a>：同章前篇——「照上下文做反而错」往往正是过期条目在作祟。</li>\n<li><a href=\"context-as-living-doc\">把上下文当活文档</a>：同章后篇——把纠错回路上升为持续运转的维护态度。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../writing-effective-context/conventions-and-gotchas\">约定与坑</a>：诊断出缺口之后的两类写法规范——可判定的约定与显眼的警告。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"从反复出错反推该补什么","id":"从反复出错反推该补什么"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"四类信号的诊断表","id":"四类信号的诊断表"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么\"反复\"才是阈值","id":"为什么-反复-才是阈值"},{"level":2,"text":"回路怎么转起来","id":"回路怎么转起来"},{"level":2,"text":"别让补丁变成新病","id":"别让补丁变成新病"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"相关阅读","id":"相关阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"保持上下文新鲜","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/project-context-files/maintaining-context-files/keeping-context-fresh"},"next":{"title":"把上下文当活文档","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/project-context-files/maintaining-context-files/context-as-living-doc"}}